# Project-root .env selector — points at the active data directory.
#
# Per-run configuration (URL, auth, LLM model, embedding, gleaning) lives in
# <data-dir>/config/.env — NOT here. This file only selects which data dir
# unflagged CLI invocations should use.
#
# To bootstrap a new forum:
#   1. Set DISCOURSE_DATA_DIR below to the directory you want to create.
#   2. mkdir -p $DISCOURSE_DATA_DIR/config
#   3. cp discourse_explorer/config/env.example $DISCOURSE_DATA_DIR/config/.env
#   4. Edit $DISCOURSE_DATA_DIR/config/.env — fill in URL, auth, etc.
#
# Shell exports override this file. Override for one session with:
#   export DISCOURSE_DATA_DIR=./data/other-forum

DISCOURSE_DATA_DIR=./data/my-forum
